      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div>[2024] 1st Human-inspired Computer Vision Workshop — ECCV 2024</div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div>[2022] 37th ACM/SIGAPP SAC 2022 — GMLR track</div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div>[2022] The 5th International Conference on Soft Computing and Data Mining (SCDM 2022)</div></div>
