    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div><span class="badge badge-accent">Award</span> [2025] Outstanding Reviewer — ICCV 2025</div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div><span class="badge">Grant</span> [2025] BrainCap and BrainNet: An Affordable Integrated Solution for EEG Acquisition, Analysis, and BCI System Development — Bando a cascata ANTHEM, Spoke 1 “Data and technology driven diagnosis and therapies”.</div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div><span class="badge">Grant</span> [2024] DIAERESES: DysmorphIc fAcE REcognition in rare SyndromES — My first SEED Grant, Università degli Studi di Milano.</div></div>
